<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title><%= title %> - EliteHackLab</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css"></head>
<body>
  <div class="matrix-bg"></div>
  <nav class="main-nav"><div class="nav-brand"><span class="brand-icon">💀</span><span class="brand-text">Elite<span class="highlight">Hack</span>Lab</span></div><div class="nav-links"><a href="/"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Dashboard</a></div></nav>
  <div class="lab-container">
    <div class="lab-header"><h1>🔮 Cookie Deserialization</h1><div class="lab-info"><span class="lab-tag difficulty-hard">Hard</span></div></div>
    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-crosshairs"></i> Objective</h2>
      <p>The session cookie is a base64-encoded JSON object. Decode it, modify the role/isAdmin field, re-encode and submit to escalate privileges.</p>
      <p><strong>Your cookie:</strong> <code><%= cookieData %></code></p>
    </div>
    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-terminal"></i> Cookie Verifier</h2>
      <div class="vulnerable-form">
        <label>Modified cookie (base64):</label>
        <input type="text" id="cookieInput" value="<%= cookieData %>" autocomplete="off">
        <button onclick="verifyCookie()" class="btn">Verify</button>
        <button onclick="decodeCookie()" class="btn btn-blue" style="margin-top:0.5rem;">Decode Current</button>
      </div>
      <div id="cookieResult" class="result-box" style="margin-top:1rem;"></div>
      <div class="code-block">Steps:
1. Decode: atob("<%= cookieData %>") → {"user":"guest","role":"user","isAdmin":false}
2. Modify: {"user":"guest","role":"admin","isAdmin":true}
3. Re-encode: btoa(JSON.stringify({...}))
4. Submit the new base64 string</div>
    </div>
    <div class="flag-submit"><h3><i class="fas fa-flag"></i> Capture The Flag</h3>
      <form onsubmit="submitFlagInline('deserialization','flagInput_des2','flagResult_des2'); return false;" style="display:flex; gap:0.5rem; max-width:500px; margin:0 auto;"><input type="text" id="flagInput_des2" placeholder="FLAG{...}" autocomplete="off"><button type="submit" class="btn">Submit</button></form>
      <div id="flagResult_des2" style="display:none; margin-top:1rem;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  <script>
    function decodeCookie() {
      try { document.getElementById('cookieResult').innerHTML = '<pre>Decoded: '+atob(document.getElementById('cookieInput').value)+'</pre>'; } catch(e) { document.getElementById('cookieResult').innerHTML = 'Decode error: '+e.message; }
    }
    async function verifyCookie() {
      const res = await fetch('/labs/deserialization/cookie/verify', { method:'POST', headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'}, body:JSON.stringify({cookie:document.getElementById('cookieInput').value}) });
      document.getElementById('cookieResult').innerHTML = '<pre>'+JSON.stringify(await res.json(),null,2)+'</pre>';
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
